1
00:00:00,077 --> 00:00:03,207
l want to make a good impression.
No offense, but with you here...

2
00:00:03,413 --> 00:00:05,583
...l look like I'm 6'2".

3
00:00:07,584 --> 00:00:10,374
The nuns always chaperoned
the dances at my high school.

4
00:00:10,587 --> 00:00:13,177
(Bernadette:)They used to make us leave room
between us for the Holy Spirit.

5
00:00:13,382 --> 00:00:14,422
Hmm.

6
00:00:14,633 --> 00:00:18,973
(Howard:)Hindus do the same thing.
Except they leave room for a cow. Ha, ha.

7
00:00:19,763 --> 00:00:21,893
(Raj:)Listen, I love your charming
racist humor.

8
00:00:22,099 --> 00:00:24,939
But any chance you could not mock
my religion while she's here?

9
00:00:25,143 --> 00:00:29,233
(Howard:)- You made fun of me for eating lox.
- Your people don't worship lox.

10
00:00:29,439 --> 00:00:31,979
(Howard:)Clearly you've never been to brunch
with my cousins.

11
00:00:32,984 --> 00:00:35,274
(Bernadette:)So arranged marriages,
the parents just decide...

12
00:00:35,487 --> 00:00:36,817
...and then you get married?

13
00:00:37,030 --> 00:00:40,740
Oh, no, no. I get a say in it. I'm sure
whoever shows up will be better company...

14
00:00:40,951 --> 00:00:44,701
...than the threesome l've been having
with Aunt Jemima and Mrs. Butterworth.

15
00:00:46,998 --> 00:00:48,458
(Girl:)Excuse me, are you Rajesh?

16
00:00:48,667 --> 00:00:50,957
(Raj:)Oh, yes. You must be Lakshmi.

17
00:00:51,169 --> 00:00:53,169
(Raj:)- Uh, nice to meet you.
- Nice to meet you too.

18
00:00:53,380 --> 00:00:56,470
Oh, uh, these are my friends.
Uh, this is Bernadette.

19
00:00:56,675 --> 00:00:58,025
- Hello.
- Uh, and this is Howard.

